  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HBWU-Promote Women Empowerment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to raise awareness about the Cybersecurity Law and new points in the Law on Marriage and Family amongst women, especially those of ethnic minorities, thereby contributing to women&#x2019;s economic empowerment. The result, further, is expected to significantly contribute to the promotion of gender equality, looking forwards to the future when &#x201c;women know the policy to protect their legitimate rights&quot; in the family and in society. Activities are implemented in Yen Thuy and Lac Son districts, HoaBinh province. Focusing on increasing awareness by means of women-centered approaches, communications activities to disseminate the Law on Cybersecurity, Law on Marriage and Family are organized, expecting the emergence of effectively implemented models to replicate. Women-friendlyspaces are created in addition to the organization of raising awareness trainings. Furthermore, multidisciplinary cooperation in communication, legal aid and consulting is also of top priority to reinforce throughout the implementation. Overall, the total number of beneficiaries is expected to be 3600, including people in project areas, officials of provincial, district and commune associations, officials of justice departments at grassroot levels, those working in cultural sector and socio-political organizations or security.</narrative>
  </description>
  <participating-org role="1" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">European Union</narrative>
  </participating-org>
  <participating-org role="4" type="24">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hoa Binh Provincial Women&apos;s Union, which is directly under the Vietnam Women&apos;s Union, operates in Hoa Binh province with following functions and tasks
-Representing and protecting rights and legitimate interests of women from all strata of society, participating in building the Party, State management; Uniting and mobilizing women to implement the Party&apos;s guidelines and policies, the State&apos;s policies and laws;
-Conducting propaganda activities and educating women about politics, ideology, revolutionaryideals, moral qualities, lifestyles;
-Implementing the Party&apos;s guidelines and policies, the State&apos;s policies and laws, participating in building the Party and the State, developing the socio-economic and national defense;
-Advocating and supporting women in improving their capacity and qualifications, improving their material and spiritual lives for happy families;
-Advising and proposing, participating in constructing and criticizing society and supervising the implementation of the Party&apos;s guidelinesand policies, the State&apos;s policies and laws related to rights and legitimate interests of women, family, children and gender equality;
-Building and developing a strong organization;
-Uniting and cooperating with women, progressive organizations and individuals in the world for equality, development and peace.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hoa Binh Women Union</narrative>
  </participating-org>
